# Non-runtime files excluded from container images (Fixes #820)
#
# .buildkite/ is not one of them. On the Kubernetes lane the pod is the
# container and there is no checkout beside it, so a multi-host slice runs
# .buildkite/kubernetes/multihost_entry.sh out of the image.
